  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_sort",
  "prompt": "The query in the editor has one mistake. Fix it so that it answers this question: which 3 products in category 3 (TVs 65 inch and up) have the highest unit cost? Return product_id, product_name and unit_cost_eur, in that order, with exactly these column names, most expensive first. When products tie on unit_cost_eur, the one whose product_name comes first from A to Z wins the place. Products with no unit cost do not count. Return exactly 3 rows.",
